; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR GETTING WARMER  -  guess the number from 1 to 1000   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot, press any key. Type a guess and Enter; you are told to go
; higher or lower and, from the second guess on, whether you are getting
; warmer or colder than your last guess. Ten guesses - always enough if you
; halve the range each time. Anything that is not a number from 1 to 1000
; does not use a guess; Q gives up, Esc quits. Y plays again, N quits.
;
; Plain text - no VT100 codes needed.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/warmer_verify.py, V0061.34): PASS 2026-11-22 with the sounds (type M): halving, random players, edges, rerun.
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-10-01 - Craig: "Getting Warmer works."
;
; 296 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A                    Ten
; D 4005 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: the index for writing variables
; D 4009 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 400C 2F 0B 07 DC    WRITEIDX R11 07DC                  NBUF ends in a 0
; D 4010 11 06 00 00    LOADXI R6 0000                     no games yet
; D 4014 11 07 00 00    LOADXI R7 0000
; D 4018 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 401C 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 401F 2F 0B 07 DD    WRITEIDX R11 07DD                  the sound on
; D 4023 11 0E 04 00    LOADXI R14 0400
; D 4027 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; TW:
; D 4029 C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes
; D 402A CC             SERST
; D 402B A1 00 29       IFFALSEI TW
; D 402E CB             SERIN                              the key itself does not matter -
; D 402F 81 00 1B       TESTAI 001B
; D 4032 A1 00 43       IFFALSEI NEW                       but a lone ESC quits
; D 4035 BD 02 51       CALL GETLW
; D 4038 A1 02 0E       IFFALSEI BYEQ
; D 403B CB             SERIN                              an arrow (ESC [ x): its two bytes are thrown away
; D 403C BD 02 51       CALL GETLW
; D 403F A1 00 43       IFFALSEI NEW
; D 4042 CB             SERIN
; NEW:
; D 4043 C3             RAND
; D 4044 21 01          COPYAX Acc -> R1
; D 4046 11 0C 03 E8    LOADXI R12 03E8
; D 404A 4D 1C          DIVXY R1 / R12
; D 404C 27             COPYREMA
; D 404D 4E 00 01       ADDAI 0001
; D 4050 21 01          COPYAX Acc -> R1                   the number: 1-1000
; D 4052 11 02 00 00    LOADXI R2 0000                     no guesses yet
; D 4056 11 04 00 00    LOADXI R4 0000                     no last distance
; D 405A 42 06          INCX R6                            one more game
; D 405C 11 0E 05 4A    LOADXI R14 054A
; D 4060 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; ASK:
; D 4062 11 0E 05 77    LOADXI R14 0577
; D 4066 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4068 23 00 2A       COPYXY R2 -> R10
; D 406B 42 0A          INCX R10
